			<td>
			<h3><a href="https://opennj.net/AA00001664/00001"><img alt="Click here to access the lab manual" src="https://opennj.net/design/aggregations/industrial-hygiene/uploads/IndusHygieneII.png" style="height:135px; width:250px" /><em>Click here to access the lab manual</em></a>&nbsp;</h3>

